# Browser VAD and ONNX Runtime assets (~80MB of .wasm and .onnx), copied out of
# the pinned `onnxruntime-web` and `@ricky0123/vad-web` dependencies by the
# `prepare-voice-assets` target. Generated, never committed: resolving them from
# node_modules is what keeps the wasm binaries matched to the JavaScript loader
# that reads them, so a checked-in copy could only ever drift from the lockfile.
#
# Keeping them untracked also keeps them out of history. jj has no Git LFS
# support, so a single accidental snapshot would put 80MB in every clone
# permanently, recoverable only by rewriting history across every workspace.
**/public/vad-web/


# voice e2e artifacts
apps/demo/e2e/voice/audio
test_with_credentials.sh
